 "description": "<p>A feather tickler on a leather-wrapped handle, in two styles: 5014 at 46 cm and 5015 at 48 cm. The length difference is the entire choice between them - both run the same feather-and-leather construction.</p>\n<p>Feather ticklers are the gentle entry point of the sensory-accessory category, and the leather handle is what separates a real one from a craft-store feather. Polyester-and-leather build per the specs.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester and leather</li>\n<li>Item type: feather tickler</li>\n<li>Styles: 5014 (46 cm), 5015 (48 cm)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick by length at order. The two-centimeter difference matters more than it sounds in use.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Leather-handle feather tickler in two styles, 46 and 48 cm, sensory accessory.</p>\n",
